  "body": "!MGPzswjKaKwEyQHnpl:matrix.org\r\n#freenode_#krita:matrix.org\r\n#krita:kde.org\r\n\r\nTrying to promote someone in this room. But get errors\r\n\r\n`/_synapse/admin/v1/rooms/<room_id_or_alias>/make_room_admin` returns\r\n`{\"errcode\":\"M_UNKNOWN\",\"error\":\"No local admin user in room with power to update power levels.\"}`\r\n\r\n`/_matrix/client/r0/join/{{roomId}}`\r\n```html\r\n<html>\r\n\r\n<body>\r\n\t<h1>429 Too Many Requests</h1>\r\n\tNo server is available to handle this request.\r\n</body>\r\n\r\n</html>\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe room is a v1 room created by @appservice-irc:matrix.org\r\n\r\nMy contact is in the room and say it shows the IRC bot as a room member, but when calling `/_matrix/client/r0/rooms/{{roomId}}/state/m.room.power_levels`:\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n    \"errcode\": \"M_FORBIDDEN\",\r\n    \"error\": \"User @appservice-irc:matrix.org not in room !MGPzswjKaKwEyQHnpl:matrix.org, and room previews are disabled\"\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nContact got an error when trying to invite @support:matrix.org and the IRC bot.\r\n\r\nWhen they invited me, I got the invite, but am unable to join the room. The invite is persisting.\r\nThe room does however show me as joined\r\n```json\r\n{\r\n  \"content\": {\r\n    \"avatar_url\": \"mxc://twilightsparkle.dev/TkIuQGnsGzKAJGYPeXukNZkn\",\r\n    \"displayname\": \"twilight\",\r\n    \"membership\": \"join\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"event_id\": \"$162384152139WFPqo:twilightsparkle.dev\",\r\n  \"origin_server_ts\": 1623841521819,\r\n  \"sender\": \"@twilight:twilightsparkle.dev\",\r\n  \"state_key\": \"@twilight:twilightsparkle.dev\",\r\n  \"type\": \"m.room.member\",\r\n  \"unsigned\": {\r\n    \"age\": 44,\r\n    \"replaces_state\": \"$162384150640309pQCBi:kde.org\",\r\n    \"prev_content\": {\r\n      \"avatar_url\": \"mxc://twilightsparkle.dev/TkIuQGnsGzKAJGYPeXukNZkn\",\r\n      \"displayname\": \"twilight\",\r\n      \"membership\": \"invite\"\r\n    },\r\n    \"prev_sender\": \"@someone:domain.com\"\r\n  },\r\n  \"room_id\": \"!MGPzswjKaKwEyQHnpl:matrix.org\"\r\n}\r\n```",
